{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 36, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler a journey to Nippon I shall weave for thee a plan most grand.\n\n**Day the First Arrival in Tokyo's Land**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive at Narita's gate\nA bustling city awaits a wondrous state.\nTo Shinjuku's heights we swiftly go\nA hotel found a comfortable show.\nThen dinner's feast a ramen's delight\nTo banish weariness embrace the night.\n\n**Day the Second Tokyo's Wonders**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple we shall tread\nSenso-ji's beauty overhead.\nThe Imperial Palace a sight to behold\nStories of emperors bravely told.\nHarajuku's fashion a vibrant scene\nYouthful spirits ever keen.\nShibuya's crossing a human tide\nWhere countless souls in motion ride.\n\n**Day the Third Hakone's Mountain Grace**\n\nHakone's mountains a verdant dream\nLake Ashi's waters a silver gleam.\nA cruise we'll take a scenic ride\nVolcanic hot springs where troubles hide.\nArt museums grand a cultural grace\nA peaceful respite a tranquil space.\nReturn to Tokyo as day descends\nWhere urban energy transcends.\n\n**Day the Fourth Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nBy bullet train we swiftly fly\nTo Kyoto's realm beneath the sky.\nFushimi Inari's gates a crimson hue\nA thousand torii a wondrous view.\nKiyomizu-dera temple stands so tall\nA panoramic vista enthralling all.\nGion's district geishas grace the street\nA timeless elegance bittersweet.\n\n**Day the Fifth Kyoto's Temples Gardens**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gold a dazzling sight\nThe Golden Pavilion bathed in light.\nRyoan-ji's garden a zen display\nFifteen stones in thoughtful array.\nArashiyama's bamboo grove so green\nA whispering forest a tranquil sheen.\nNijo Castle's history we'll explore\nOf shoguns past and battles sore.\n\n**Day the Sixth Nara's Deer and Todai-ji**\n\nTo Nara we journey a short bound\nWhere friendly deer abound.\nTodai-ji temple houses Buddha's might\nA colossal statue a glorious sight.\nKasuga Taisha lanterns softly glow\nA sacred place where spirits flow.\nReturn to Kyoto as twilight nears\nAnd gentle slumber conquers fears.\n\n**Day the Seventh Osaka's Culinary Delights**\n\nTo Osaka's kitchens we shall roam\nA culinary paradise a welcome home.\nDotonbori's lights a vibrant show\nStreet food delights a joyful glow.\nOsaka Castle's grandeur we embrace\nA historical landmark a noble place.\nShinsekai's charm a retro feel\nWhere memories linger ever real.\n\n**Day the Eighth Departure Farewell**\n\nWith heavy hearts we bid adieu\nTo Nippon's beauty forever true.\nFrom Kansai's airport we take our flight\nCarrying memories bathed in light.\nA land of wonders a spirit bold\nA tale to tell a story told.\n\n\n\nGo forth then traveler and treasure well\nThe memories made a magic spell.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -1.5393308401107788}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.010159211233258247}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.24510903656482697}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.4647466540336609}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.03235846757888794}, {"token": "▁Nippon", "logprob": -0.4439679980278015}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -1.1273863315582275}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.005141963250935078}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.15503114461898804}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.11316625028848648}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -4.768360213347478e-06}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.13194333016872406}, {"token": "▁plan", "logprob": -0.9671889543533325}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.059853531420230865}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.04283614829182625}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.11448658257722855}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0033001031260937452}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -4.207999518257566e-05}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.005355416797101498}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.1640206575393677}, {"token": "▁